        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vreni Schneider, Lindsey Vonn, Annemarie Moser-Pröll\n- Places: Switzerland\n- Organizations: US Ski Team\n- Roles: alpine ski racer, ski racer\n- Awards: Swiss Sportswoman of the Century\n\nFacts:\n- Vreni Schneider was born on 26 November 1964 and is a retired ski racer from Switzerland.\n- Lindsey Vonn was born on October 18, 1984, was born Lindsey Caroline Kildow, and is an American World Cup alpine ski racer on the US Ski Team.\n- Vreni Schneider is the most successful alpine ski racer from Switzerland.\n- Vreni Schneider is considered the third most successful female ski racer ever, after Lindsey Vonn and Annemarie Moser-Pröll.\n- Vreni Schneider was voted Swiss Sportswoman of the Century.",
